{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26165","headline":"赠柳氏妓 · 郑还古","name":"赠柳氏妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冶艳出神仙，歌声胜管弦。\n词轻白紵曲，歌遏碧云天。\n未拟生裴秀，如何乞郑玄。\n不堪金谷水，横过坠楼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑还古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}